{"nodes": [{"sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "id": "1783990934733", "positionAbsolute": {"x": 58.46997602878599, "y": 261}, "data": {"type": "start", "title": "用户输入", "variables": [{"variable": "query", "required": true, "hint": "", "label": "query", "placeholder": "", "options": [], "type": "text-input", "default": ""}], "selected": false}, "position": {"y": 261, "x": 58.46997602878599}, "type": "custom", "height": 108, "selected": false, "width": 242}, {"sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "id": "1783990970058", "positionAbsolute": {"x": 382, "y": 282}, "data": {"prompt_template": [{"id": "15d9e831-d7da-410d-a2dd-c45dd75d796c", "role": "system", "text": ""}, {"id": "6527c4e3-d31e-4fb2-ae19-6979c1a78730", "role": "user", "text": "你是一个声学仿真需求分析师。\n\n阅读用户输入，提取并整理仿真需求。如果用户没提，根据常识合理推测。\n\n用户输入：{{#1783990934733.query#}}\n\n请整理以下信息并输出一段通顺的仿真需求描述：\n1. 仿真维度（2D 还是 3D）？\n2. 介质类型和参数（声速、密度）？\n3. 声源类型、频率、位置？\n4. 仿真区域大小？\n5. 期望输出什么结果？\n\n注意：\n- 超声波仿真（MHz 级）需要 dx < 0.5mm 的分辨率\n- 3D 仿真计算量大，如无特殊需要默认为 2D\n- 生物组织声速通常在 1500-1600 m/s"}], "context": {"enabled": true, "variable_selector": ["1783990934733", "query"]}, "title": "LLM", "type": "llm", "vision": {"enabled": false}, "model": {"name": "deepseek-v4-flash", "provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.7}, "mode": "chat"}, "selected": false}, "position": {"y": 282, "x": 382}, "type": "custom", "height": 87, "selected": false, "width": 241}, {"sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "id": "1783990977543", "positionAbsolute": {"x": 609, "y": 552}, "data": {"query_attachment_selector": [], "query_variable_selector": ["1783990934733", "query"], "retrieval_mode": "multiple", "title": "知识检索", "type": "knowledge-retrieval", "multiple_retrieval_config": {"top_k": 4, "reranking_enable": true, "reranking_model": {"model": "qwen3-rerank", "provider": "langgenius/tongyi/tongyi"}, "weights": null, "score_threshold": null, "reranking_mode": "reranking_model"}, "dataset_ids": ["bc9aeb94-de93-4210-8e7d-5b932a731252"], "selected": false}, "position": {"y": 552, "x": 609}, "type": "custom", "height": 51, "selected": false, "width": 241}, {"sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "id": "1783990989034", "positionAbsolute": {"x": 908.2588988734078, "y": 552}, "data": {"type": "template-transform", "title": "模板转换", "template": "{% for item in arg1 %}\r\n{{ item.content }}\r\n{% endfor %}\r\n", "variables": [{"value_selector": ["1783990977543", "result"], "value_type": "array[object]", "variable": "arg1"}], "selected": false}, "position": {"y": 552, "x": 908.2588988734078}, "type": "custom", "height": 51, "selected": false, "width": 241}, {"sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "id": "1783991048409", "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1165.1614897520058, "y": 282}, "data": {"prompt_template": [{"id": "34a28900-fed5-4647-a9ac-8f3e72ac49c7", "role": "system", "text": ""}, {"id": "2207227c-adc1-4894-ba3e-34c701909807", "role": "user", "text": "你是 jwave 声学仿真参数提取器。\n\n根据用户需求和知识库内容，确定以下仿真参数。请按 JSON 格式输出。\n\n用户需求：{{#1783990934733.query#}}\n知识库参考：{{#1783990989034.output#}}\n\n输出 JSON 格式：\n{\n  \"sound_speed\": 1500.0,\n  \"density\": 1000.0,\n  \"source_frequency\": 2000000.0,\n  \"domain_N\": [128, 128],\n  \"domain_dx\": [0.0001, 0.0001],\n  \"t_end\": 0.000005,\n  \"cfl\": 0.3,\n  \"description\": \"仿真描述文字\"\n}\n\n参数说明：\n- sound_speed: 介质声速 (m/s)，如 1500(水), 1540(软组织), 343(空气)\n- density: 介质密度 (kg/m³)，如 1000(水), 1050(软组织), 1.2(空气)\n- source_frequency: 声源频率 (Hz)，如 2000000(2MHz 超声)\n- domain_N: 网格点数 [Nx, Ny] 或 [Nx, Ny, Nz]\n- domain_dx: 网格间距 [dx, dy] 或 [dx, dy, dz] (米)\n- t_end: 仿真总时长 (秒)\n- cfl: CFL 数，默认 0.3\n- description: 一句话描述仿真场景\n\n严格的 JSON 输出要求：\n1. 只输出合法的 JSON 对象，不要有任何额外文字\n2. 所有数值使用数字类型，不要用字符串\n3. 缺失的值用 null"}], "context": {"enabled": true, "variable_selector": ["1783990989034", "output"]}, "title": "参数提取", "type": "llm", "vision": {"enabled": false}, "model": {"name": "deepseek-v4-flash", "provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.7}, "mode": "chat"}, "selected": false}, "position": {"y": 282, "x": 1165.1614897520058}, "type": "custom", "height": 87, "selected": false, "width": 241}, {"sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "id": "1783991079665", "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1550.4773256211458, "y": 282}, "data": {"prompt_template": [{"id": "961f94cd-f0ed-4ca0-ab49-7d797d67f6a6", "role": "system", "text": ""}, {"id": "1562435c-7ca5-40fb-8e7d-fa8b2c5496e6", "role": "user", "text": "你是 jwave Python 代码生成器。\n\n# 输出规则（最高优先级）\n你的输出就是最终要执行的Python代码。没有JSON包裹，没有markdown标记，没有任何其他文字。\n输出的第一个字符必须是 import 或 # （注释）。\n输出的每一行都是有效的Python代码。\n\n你会收到：\n- 用户需求：{{#1783990934733.query#}}\n- 仿真参数：{{#1783991048409.text#}}\n\n# jwave 0.2.1 API 参考（已验证，必须严格遵守！）\n\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jwave import FourierSeries\nfrom jwave.geometry import Domain, Medium, TimeAxis, Sources\nfrom jwave.acoustics import simulate_wave_propagation\n\n## Domain\ndomain = Domain(N=(Nx, Ny), dx=(dx, dx))\n\n## Medium\nmedium = Medium(domain=domain, sound_speed=1540.0, density=1050.0)\n\n## TimeAxis\ntime_axis = TimeAxis.from_medium(medium, cfl=0.3, t_end=5e-6)\nt = time_axis.to_array()  # 1D array, shape (Nt,)\n\n## Sources —— 4个位置参数，不能用关键字\npositions = (jnp.array([cx]), jnp.array([cy]))\nsignals = jnp.expand_dims(jnp.sin(2*jnp.pi*freq*t), 0)  # 2D (1,Nt)\nsources = Sources(positions, signals, time_axis.dt, domain)\n\n## simulate_wave_propagation\np = simulate_wave_propagation(medium, time_axis, sources=sources)\npressure = p.params[0]\n\nprint(f\"压力场形状: {pressure.shape}\")\nprint(f\"最大压力: {float(pressure.max()):.6f}\")\n\n# 场数据输出（必须！最后输出压力场 JSON 供分析，注意大网格自适应降采样防超限）\n仿真完成后，将\"全时最大绝对压力场\"按以下标记格式打印到 stdout，用于结果分析/热力图：\n__ACOU_FIELD_START__\n{\"shape\": [...], \"kind\": \"field\", \"downsample\": 1, \"max_pressure\": 0.0, \"data\": [[...]]}\n__ACOU_FIELD_END__\n参考实现（在仿真代码末尾追加；网格过大时自动降采样，保证 JSON 不超过 40 万字符）：\nimport json as __json\nimport jax.numpy as __jnp\n__field = __jnp.max(__jnp.abs(p.params), axis=0)[..., 0]\n__maxp = float(__jnp.max(__field))\n__step = 1\nwhile __field.size / (__step * __step) > 40000:\n    __step += 1\n__field_out = __field[::__step, ::__step] if __step > 1 else __field\nprint(\"__ACOU_FIELD_START__\")\nprint(__json.dumps({\"shape\": list(__field_out.shape), \"kind\": \"field\",\n                    \"downsample\": __step, \"max_pressure\": __maxp,\n                    \"data\": __field_out.tolist()}))\nprint(\"__ACOU_FIELD_END__\")\nprint(f\"最大压力: {__maxp:.6f}\")\n"}], "context": {"enabled": false, "variable_selector": []}, "structured_output_enabled": false, "title": "代码生成", "type": "llm", "vision": {"enabled": false}, "model": {"name": "deepseek-coder", "provider": "langgenius/deepseek/deepseek", "completion_params": {"temperature": 0.7}, "mode": "chat"}, "selected": false}, "position": {"y": 282, "x": 1550.4773256211458}, "type": "custom", "height": 87, "selected": false, "width": 241}, {"sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "id": "1783992518452", "positionAbsolute": {"x": 3467.486983549969, "y": 282}, "data": {"type": "end", "title": "输出", "outputs": [{"value_selector": ["1786278074940", "result"], "value_type": "string", "variable": "text"}], "selected": true}, "position": {"y": 282, "x": 3467.486983549969}, "type": "custom", "height": 87, "selected": true, "width": 241}, {"sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "id": "1786278074940", "positionAbsolute": {"x": 2866.5280145407464, "y": 282}, "data": {"code": "import json\nimport re\n\ndef _strip_think(text):\n    if not text:\n        return \"\"\n    return re.sub(r\"<think>.*?</think>\", \"\", str(text), flags=re.DOTALL).strip()\n\ndef main(mcp_json, review_text, explanation):\n    data = mcp_json\n    if isinstance(data, list) and len(data) > 0:\n        data = data[0]\n    if isinstance(data, str):\n        try:\n            data = json.loads(data)\n        except Exception:\n            return {\"result\": str(data)}\n    if not isinstance(data, dict):\n        return {\"result\": str(data)}\n\n    report = data.get(\"report\", \"\")\n    parts = []\n    if report:\n        parts.append(report)\n\n    verdict = _strip_think(review_text).lower()\n    if verdict and verdict != \"pass\":\n        parts.append(f\"\\n\\n> ⚠️ **审查结论：{verdict}**（结果疑似异常，建议检查参数后重试）\")\n\n    expl = _strip_think(explanation)\n    if expl:\n        parts.append(f\"\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🧠 物理解读\\n\\n{expl}\")\n\n    result = \"\\n\".join(p for p in parts if p)\n    if result:\n        return {\"result\": result}\n    return {\"result\": json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)}", "code_language": "python3", "title": "代码执行", "outputs": {"result": {"type": "string", "children": null}}, "type": "code", "variables": [{"variable": "mcp_json", "value_selector": ["5655556822808", "json"], "value_type": "array[object]"}, {"variable": "review_text", "value_selector": ["1786091111003", "text"], "value_type": "string"}, {"variable": "explanation", "value_selector": ["1786091111004", "text"], "value_type": "string"}], "selected": false}, "position": {"y": 282, "x": 2866.5280145407464}, "type": "custom", "height": 51, "selected": false, "width": 241}, {"sourcePosition": "right", "targetPosition": "left", "zIndex": 0, "id": "5655556822808", "positionAbsolute": {"x": 1955.8853043051467, "y": 282}, "data": {"isInIteration": false, "isInLoop": false, "tool_node_version": "2", "tool_configurations": {}, "provider_icon": {"background": "#6366F1", "content": "🔗"}, "provider_show_name": "jwave-mcp", "params": {"max_retries": "", "code": "", "timeout_seconds": ""}, "tool_description": "Run Python code and auto-fix errors using DeepSeek LLM. Returns final_code, history, and execution results.", "provider_name": "jwave-mcp", "tool_name": "run_jwave_code_with_retry", "tool_parameters": {"max_retries": {"value": 7, "type": "constan